            <p>
                About ABB Ability™ MES for pulp and paper
            </p>
            <p>
                Based on decades of experience in supplying infor-mation and operational technology to the sector, ABB Ability™ MES for pulp and paper consists of in-tegrated enterprise software modules that bring together business and manufacturing information to help papermakers make decisions based on the financial impacts of production choices. ABB's modular and flexible MES applications cover all core functionalities, from order-order-through-invoice.
            </p>
            <p>
                These modules work seamlessly together and can be further enhanced with other ABB Ability™ appli-cations for pulp and paper to help you achieve new levels of operational efficiency.
